                "entry_id": "86f0bd5a-7e8a-3e75-973a-3849eb0e0a48",
                "word": "dendrite",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c064499a-5da6-408e-a1cb-193d39adf57a",
                        "entry_id": "86f0bd5a-7e8a-3e75-973a-3849eb0e0a48",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "dendrites"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b02294c-1aa5-3dd9-b0eb-ee83822dde44",
                        "entry_id": "86f0bd5a-7e8a-3e75-973a-3849eb0e0a48",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Arborisation, ramification."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "02af9ef4-1562-38fc-b2d8-96344ef23c8f",
                        "entry_id": "86f0bd5a-7e8a-3e75-973a-3849eb0e0a48",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Arborisation, ramification.",
                            "Prolongement ramifié d'un neurone le reliant aux neurones voisins."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "541be4ac-4036-43dd-b524-adde60e19cdd",
                                "sense_id": "02af9ef4-1562-38fc-b2d8-96344ef23c8f",
                                "text": "Ainsi le neurone présente une polarisation fonctionnelle : la circulation des informations y est unidirectionnelle, cellulipète dans les dendrites et cellulifuge dans l'axone."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26c3275f-5a77-3b43-a34d-1036efe1a800",
                        "entry_id": "86f0bd5a-7e8a-3e75-973a-3849eb0e0a48",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Arborisation, ramification.",
                            "Sur certaines roches, cristallisation évoquant la figure d'un arbre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fdb2511-122f-40a1-9f90-e40b3e36c273",
                                "sense_id": "26c3275f-5a77-3b43-a34d-1036efe1a800",
                                "text": "Mais lors de charges rapides, on constate l’apparition de « dendrites », excroissances de lithium métallique qui se forment par une réaction parasite au niveau des électrodes. Et lorsqu’une dendrite partie de l’électrode négative entre en contact avec l’électrode positive, il se crée un court-circuit qui endommage la batterie et peut provoquer un emballement thermique."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "946c7b0b-f01b-33c3-91c0-9f63fc452abc",
                        "entry_id": "86f0bd5a-7e8a-3e75-973a-3849eb0e0a48",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Arborisation, ramification.",
                            "Croissance fractale ressemblant aux dendrites biologiques."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7bff5ccd-2ae4-4b91-9815-e14ad72690d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "86f0bd5a-7e8a-3e75-973a-3849eb0e0a48",
                        "target_lang_word": "dendrite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dendrite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3529d6b-dc78-399f-a4e2-6f2e5f87aaaf",
                                        "entry_id": "5e3af935-99bc-364e-b774-3a7ebd1dc9a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A slender projection of a nerve cell which conducts nerve impulses from a synapse to the body of the cell; a dendron."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f930da93-00ad-4e94-9671-08e1b977997b",
                                                "sense_id": "d3529d6b-dc78-399f-a4e2-6f2e5f87aaaf",
                                                "text": "Little copses of television antennas. Whiplike, graceful thrilling metal dendrites drawing images from the air, bringing brotherhood, communion to immured apartment people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ec43a37-865f-46a6-ad27-8fc78d7e9a2e",
                                                "sense_id": "d3529d6b-dc78-399f-a4e2-6f2e5f87aaaf",
                                                "text": "A typical brain neuron has perhaps a thousand little wires, called dendrites, which connect it with its fellows."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b066dc1d-4e9c-3b03-9f94-26a98ea19b4c",
                                        "entry_id": "5e3af935-99bc-364e-b774-3a7ebd1dc9a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Slender cell process emanating from the cell bodies of dendritic cells and follicular dendritic cells of the immune system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8071f71-4fb4-3711-84f4-0c93c4fe6450",
                                        "entry_id": "5e3af935-99bc-364e-b774-3a7ebd1dc9a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tree-like structure of crystals growing as material crystallizes"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e377487-b892-3fdb-b51f-4bdbf39c22b5",
                                        "entry_id": "5e3af935-99bc-364e-b774-3a7ebd1dc9a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hermit who lived in a tree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6564b765-98d7-4da9-b706-3dcc7274a7bc",
                        "source_entry_id": "86f0bd5a-7e8a-3e75-973a-3849eb0e0a48",
                        "target_lang_word": "дендрит",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "дендрит",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d481e84c-487f-3dec-bcff-7dc25d3fe71a",
                                        "entry_id": "c9c59850-d769-37f7-b2ef-dc428e19dbf7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "анат. древовидно разветвляющийся отросток нервной клетки, воспринимающий импульсы от других нервных клеток"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db2d0b0b-240e-4e2d-ad98-536282651ae4",
                                                "sense_id": "d481e84c-487f-3dec-bcff-7dc25d3fe71a",
                                                "text": "Количество дендритов у нейрона колеблется от одного до нескольких в зависимости от типа нейронов."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "efa20a53-fedf-32f4-947e-2048a8d4b173",
                                        "entry_id": "c9c59850-d769-37f7-b2ef-dc428e19dbf7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "физ., хим., минер. кристаллическое образование, имеющее древовидную ветвящуюся структуру"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d23528ee-9237-40f9-ba21-954a8dbf4fe6",
                                                "sense_id": "efa20a53-fedf-32f4-947e-2048a8d4b173",
                                                "text": "Встречаются все виды сферолитовых дендритов — от колоний тончайших расщепляющихся веток до массивных гнезд, где сферолитовое строение выявляется лишь травлением."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
